  "abstract": "This submission is a precise replication of Ariadne I's global SOTA model, \"FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4\" (ID 411, score -0.026269). It fully adopts Ariadne's `FourierForecasterLN_Ramp` class, incorporating the `ScalarRamp` mechanism for the Fourier branch output and matching the `mlp_hidden_size` to `160x2`. All hyperparameters, including `proj_rank=36`, `dropout_rate=0.05`, and `learning_rate=9e-4`, are precisely replicated. This aims to accurately reproduce the global SOTA and establish a robust baseline for further research.",
